            "heading": "General-Wellness Features",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>ENLOVA™ Water offers a simple way to keep drinking water available for ordinary daily use.</p><ul><li>Convenient bottled water for everyday drinking</li><li>Twenty-four individually sealed 16.9 fl oz / 500 mL bottles per case</li><li>Suitable for home, office, meals, travel where permitted, or rotated emergency supplies</li><li>Clearly labeled source, bottler, lot, best-by, and quality information after approval</li><li>Requires no electricity, preparation, charging, waiting period, or special equipment</li><li>Complements a mindful hydration routine within a balanced lifestyle</li></ul><p>No claim is made that ENLOVA™ Water hydrates better than other compliant bottled water or improves circulation, metabolism, cognition, sleep, recovery, energy, or physical performance.</p>",
