            "row_content": "<p>ENLOVA™ Water may suit people who:</p><ul><li>Want convenient bottled water for ordinary consumption</li><li>Keep sealed drinking water available at home or work</li><li>Prefer individually sealed portions</li><li>Want a 24-bottle case for a household or workplace</li><li>Include mindful hydration in a balanced lifestyle</li></ul><p>Fluid needs vary. People with medically directed fluid, sodium, mineral, kidney, cardiac, or other dietary restrictions should follow professional guidance.</p>",
